<!doctype html>

<html lang="<%= site.metadata.lang %>">
  <head>
    <script>
      (() => {
        const saved = localStorage.getItem("theme")
        const prefersDark = matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches
        const theme = saved === "light" || saved === "dark" ? saved : (prefersDark ? "dark" : "light")
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = theme
      })()
    </script>

    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">

    <meta
      name="theme-color"
      content="<%= site.metadata.theme_color_light %>"
      media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)"
    >

    <meta
      name="theme-color"
      content="<%= site.metadata.theme_color %>"
      media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"
    >

    <% if data.noindex %>
      <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
    <% else %>
      <meta name="robots" content="max-image-preview:large">
    <% end %>

    <%= render Util::Seo.new(resource: resource) %>
    <%= render Util::StructuredData.new(resource: resource) %>

    <link
      rel="alternate"
      type="application/atom+xml"
      title="<%= site.metadata.title %> (Atom)"
      href="<%= absolute_url("/feed.xml") %>"
    >

    <link
      rel="alternate"
      type="application/feed+json"
      title="<%= site.metadata.title %> (JSON Feed)"
      href="<%= absolute_url("/feed.json") %>"
    >

    <link
      rel="sitemap"
      type="application/xml"
      title="Sitemap"
      href="<%= absolute_url("/sitemap.xml") %>"
    >

    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">

    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      sizes="32x32"
      href="/images/favicon-32x32.png"
    >

    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      sizes="16x16"
      href="/images/favicon-16x16.png"
    >

    <link
      rel="apple-touch-icon"
      sizes="180x180"
      href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png"
    >

    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">

    <link
      rel="webmention"
      href="https://webmention.io/andrewm.codes/webmention"
    >

    <link rel="pingback" href="https://webmention.io/andrewm.codes/xmlrpc">

    <link rel="me" href="https://bsky.app/profile/andrewm.codes">
    <link rel="me" href="https://github.com/andrewmcodes">
    <link rel="me" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrew-mason">
    <link rel="me" href="https://x.com/andrewmcodes">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= asset_path :css %>">

    <script src="<%= asset_path :js %>" defer></script>
  </head>

  <body
    class="
      bg-slate-1 text-slate-12 font-sans text-body
      min-h-screen flex flex-col
    "
  >
    <!--
      THESIS: The category standard for an engineer's site, executed at a craft
      level the category rarely reaches. It refuses the concept arrangement that
      would make a working archive perform as a gallery.
      OWN-WORLD: A Radix slate ground carrying the whole interface, composed
      dark-first; one ruby accent spent only on state; amber reserved for
      staleness. Archivo for chrome, Source Serif 4 for the reading column,
      Geist Mono for measurement. Hairline rules, no ambient shadow. Rows carry
      chronology, grids carry parallel peers, and nothing else is a grid.
      STORY: A stranger reads accumulation as the argument — the posts, tools,
      episodes and talks are the proof — and leaves knowing what he actually does.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: Name and standfirst left-ranged with the derived index
      ledger beside them and the primary action inline. Never a centered hero.
      FORM: The category standard, played straight. The roll assigned candidate
      4 of 7 (a technical-publishing series); canon was chosen over it. Seed 393f5e14.
      FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
    -->

    <%= render SkipLink.new %>

    <%= render Topbar.new(resource: resource) %>

    <%= render MainContent.new(kind: data.kind) do %>
      <%= yield %>
    <% end %>

    <%= render SiteFooter.new %>
    <%= render Cmdk.new %>
  </body>
</html>
